{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2010-common-biology-18","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2010,"subject":"biology","number":18,"points":2,"unitId":"plant","unitLabel":"식물 구조·생리","topic":"기공·앱시스산","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["plant","metabolism","immune"],"stem":"다음은 열 충격 및 가뭄이 담배(Nicotiana tabacum)의  광합성 및 \n세포호흡, 기공 전도도 그리고 잎 온도에 미치는 영향을 조사한 결과\n이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 이 식물은 열 충격보다 가뭄에 의해 더 큰 스트레스를 받는다.\nㄴ. 열 충격을 받으면 기공이 닫히고 세포호흡률이 낮아진다.\nㄷ. 가뭄 조건에서는 앱시스산(ABA)이 축적되고 광합성이 억제\n된다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t010"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":475,"height":325,"region":0,"bbox":[74.68,72.503,190.0,130.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-18/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":475,"height":330,"region":0,"bbox":[73.88,212.503,190.0,132.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-18/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":473,"height":330,"region":0,"bbox":[74.68,356.503,189.2,132.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-18/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":775,"height":227,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,541.303,310.0,90.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-18/04.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":10,"sourceRect":[430.12,152.297,759.1,836.482],"width":328.98,"height":684.185,"items":[{"type":"image